00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:52.980
El giro democratizador

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:53.560
es Copilot.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.200
Convierte toda esta complejidad

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:55.920
